script = ExtResource("1_xlmsx")
dialogue_id = "debate_war_machine"
record_title = "Debate Speech: Weapons of War"
text = "PAGE: historian(PORTAL_NETWORK), AUDIENCE
historian: Have you ever wondered about the great metal constructs we keep finding on various shards?
historian: Or why we only find them in the wastelands?
historian: Well, scholars have done much research into the topic, and as far as we can tell these metal constructs were the cause of the wastelands.
historian: These were ancient weapons, older than the oldest artifact we have from before the Shattering.
historian: Even the language used by the people who built them is completely alien to us.
historian: We have no idea how they worked, and perhaps it makes me a bad scholar, but I hope we never learn.
historian: We all think war on this scale is the domain of ancient legends, nothing we could ever encounter in this modern world.
historian: Perhaps the reason we think so is because our shards have limited the scale of conflict.
historian: A warlord may conquer their shard, but if their ambition extends to other shards, the defenders can simply bar the gates.
historian: The Cloud Sea might be an inconvenience for our merchants, but it is also a very effective moat."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://jtkfcsyiryo4"
